<title>USA: PepsiCo names $10b restaurant spinoff Tricon.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo names $10b restaurant spinoff Tricon.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PepsiCo Inc said Thursday the name of its $10 billion restaurant company would be Tricon Global Restaurants Inc.</p>
<p>Tricon, comprised of the global businesses of Pizza Hut, KFC and Taco Bell, will be spun off to shareholders later this year.</p>
<p>Tricon will have estimated annual revenues of $10 billion.</p>
<p>The spin off of PepsiCo's restaurants was announced in January.</p>
</text>
